# Python

- This repo targets Python 3.11+ (`requires-python` in pyproject.toml). The core stays stdlib-only.
- A new runtime dependency needs a one-line justification in the PR and a pinned lower bound in pyproject.
- Type hints on all public functions; `from __future__ import annotations` where useful.
- No bare `except:`; no `except Exception: pass` in any decision path. Raise specific exceptions.
- Deterministic by default: seed every RNG, sort dict/set iteration before hashing or printing, freeze timestamps in tests.
- Secrets via `os.environ` only; never log secret values; never write them to `runs/`.
- Use `pathlib`; no hard-coded absolute paths (no `/Users/...`, no personal venv fallbacks).
